{"1861330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NEUROSYNTH", "steam_appid": 1861330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>NEUROSYNTH</strong> is a 4-player co-op survival horror game where consciousness is no longer bound to the body. Play as NullRunners, cloned operatives who jack into the Null, a dimension of unknown origin filled with hostile entities and unstable environments. Take on dangerous contracts for competing factions as you extract data, eliminate threats, and uncover the secrets of the Null. Each deployment is a high-risk mission where failure means losing your clone and everything you gathered, while success rewards resources, upgrades, and new strategic options.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Survival Horror:</strong> Face atmospheric dread, deadly entities, scarce resources, and nail-biting combat where every decision matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op/Asynchronous Multiplayer:</strong> Enter the Null with up to 3 other runners, complete contracts as a team, and come across the remnants of other players’ failed runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Visceral  Combat:</strong> Engage in intense first-person melee and ranged combat with weighty, punishing encounters inspired by Souls-like design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong> Collect NPE (Null-Point Energy) and invest it into attributes and skills to grow stronger, unlock new potential, and take on more dangerous contracts. Shape unique builds around different playstyles and roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting Economy:</strong> Craft weapons, supplies, and mods through a deep survival-driven economy that rewards preparation and smart resource use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Take on contracts with randomized conditions, including time of day, weather, and modifiers, for a fresh experience every run.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>NEUROSYNTH</strong> is a 4-player co-op survival horror game where consciousness is no longer bound to the body. Play as NullRunners, cloned operatives who jack into the Null, a dimension of unknown origin filled with hostile entities and unstable environments. Take on dangerous contracts for competing factions as you extract data, eliminate threats, and uncover the secrets of the Null. Each deployment is a high-risk mission where failure means losing your clone and everything you gathered, while success rewards resources, upgrades, and new strategic options.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Survival Horror:</strong> Face atmospheric dread, deadly entities, scarce resources, and nail-biting combat where every decision matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op/Asynchronous Multiplayer:</strong> Enter the Null with up to 3 other runners, complete contracts as a team, and come across the remnants of other players’ failed runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Visceral  Combat:</strong> Engage in intense first-person melee and ranged combat with weighty, punishing encounters inspired by Souls-like design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong> Collect NPE (Null-Point Energy) and invest it into attributes and skills to grow stronger, unlock new potential, and take on more dangerous contracts. Shape unique builds around different playstyles and roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting Economy:</strong> Craft weapons, supplies, and mods through a deep survival-driven economy that rewards preparation and smart resource use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</stron